  "title": "Chili That Actually Slaps",
  "description": "Most homemade chili tastes like tomato soup with ground beef in it. This one does not. Layered seasoning, soy and Worcestershire for depth, apple cider vinegar to wake it up, and a pinch of cocoa nobody tastes but everybody feels. Low and slow handles the rest. Serves 6 to 8.",
